WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
SabiBook. Say what you sold. SabiBook writes it down.

00:02.500 --> 00:04.400
Hold the button and say the sale.

00:04.400 --> 00:12.900
"I sold three bags of rice to Mama Ngozi for forty five thousand. She paid thirty five. She go balance me tomorrow."

00:12.900 --> 00:18.500
Hold the button and say the sale, in Pidgin or English.

00:18.500 --> 00:22.700
Whisper writes down the words. (7 seconds cut while Whisper listens.) Then Gemma 4 turns them into a ledger entry.

00:22.700 --> 00:46.300
Check the draft. Every figure has to be one you said. (47 seconds cut while Gemma 4 writes the draft.)

00:46.300 --> 00:51.300
Nothing is saved until you tap Save.

00:51.300 --> 00:54.900
Who owes you, and how much.

00:54.900 --> 00:57.900
Open source. Runs on your own machine. github.com/dev-lawrence/sabibook
